<title>USA: Bell Atlantic, Ameritech in wireless pact.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic, Ameritech in wireless pact.</headline>
<dateline>BEDMINSTER, N.J. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic NYNEX Mobile and Ameritech Corp said on Wednesday they have signed an intercarrier agreement reaching customers in more than 30 cellular markets.</p>
<p>Based on similar agreements signed previously, customers of both companies will be able to use their cellular services in more than 70 markets in 29 states and the District of Columbia, the companies said.</p>
</text>
